		<unit label="chapter" identifier="7" level="4">Requirements Applicable to Underground Coal Mines; Mine Construction</unit>
		<unit label="article" identifier="4" level="5">Roof, Face, and Rib Control</unit>
	</structure>
	<section_number>45.2-711</section_number>
	<catch_line> Instruction of miners</catch_line>
	<text>
		The operator or his agent shall instruct all miners in the removal and installation of temporary and permanent roof supports as may be required by the roof control plan.
	</text>
